<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Nhà nước">
  <data key="d0">Nhà nước</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Nhà nước, the State of Vietnam, is the governing body responsible for managing and regulating land use in Vietnam. As the highest authority in Vietnam, Nhà nước has the power and responsibility to manage, plan, and implement policies related to land use. With its role as the representative of the landowner, Nhà nước is responsible for managing and using land according to the law, deciding on land use planning, purposes of land use, and making other decisions related to land. Nhà nước has the authority to allocate land, lease land, recognize land use rights for land users, as well as reclaim land for national defense, security, and socio-economic development purposes. In cases of land reclamation, Nhà nước is responsible for providing compensation, support, and resettlement for affected people.

Nhà nước also has the authority to manage and regulate construction, urban and rural planning, and architecture. The state decides on land policies, allocates land, leases land, reclaims land, and decides on land rental fees. Specifically, Nhà nước has the authority to lease land, collect annual land rental fees, and regulate the rights and obligations of economic organizations, public non-business units, and religious organizations. Additionally, Nhà nước has the authority to reclaim land for national defense and security purposes and approve plans for compensation, support, and resettlement.

Furthermore, Nhà nước is responsible for allocating, leasing, managing, and conserving land, as well as managing land and assets attached to it. The state also leases land, receives land use right transfers, leases land, and receives capital contributions in the form of land use rights from other economic organizations, individuals, and overseas Vietnamese. As the highest authority, Nhà nước has the power to allocate and lease land for use and is the agency responsible for reclaiming land for national defense, security, and socio-economic development purposes in the interest of the nation and the public.

In particular, Nhà nước is the organization responsible for managing and allocating land for salt production to individuals and organizations. Overall, Nhà nước plays a crucial role in managing and regulating land use in Vietnam, ensuring that land is used efficiently and effectively for the benefit of the nation and its people.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fb63b2d1bf00d8f5ee015c5506b9a4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a71913a9d910f20f81f36497d5015ca1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e1fcec8164bb65460047801e1ea46c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-339de19e4280c39c7a1aa011d12e155a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d294987fa8167f5691655f3e5aa1126&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c0019e79bce004df1e5ad11ce0c7f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8a8e6fb5e850b980bf5c26bbc952d04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07d5c9c2eb758b3f713bf3c91f86f6fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e95fa72656913e44897b9372de39ee00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6334611afd4608fc8ea538c2f2a37d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91ae11936a969234816249e7aa3f77f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d0d9901a36baf8807fac3b75de086a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e83656006c866e0bf4c6559a5d3a882&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e84a8a6194c86eaf41d74c767a7a49ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8c4697d8f9c79d651403238c3f5640&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99049055c120090c085dff849788cf6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b9cd51d144c28bf97ce93d074263e35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d51255821bf04c33a54f5cb79468a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52e88b1840bd8e004eb0f5e24c9f7e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4976f7dd42790bbf6bdb65ba91f56d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aac18a03026eb0c7177086c0eb611948&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dc518c0a7ac0d51030ecb4f6403a5ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d0ee27e69be940ef4f753775a5c0e13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7828861cdc70963d9f67a542d0daef55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb8f628ae8c6ae843b68f3a8152eb1a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762e815fcef668a5cf9405c822b66d98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e7139acd8a341aeb050adeaeb695058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bcfa5ac28b38026d775db01dc58f22c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fb91494ba903a6cbf58dd04a909a74f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5292ad6f8216f1df76baad254080945&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12437f1e5274ae5bde55c3c37817cfde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cad398132568f5feedf3d3e5d0967e63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-315e6159cb2573d8ce5fae8d943c3158&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-629e5c6e37c46d31e67eb3f34ddfbc8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df1cf85b8f6adb27f254ca957d057cb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dda70e0ad4195b08a3a6188953301fb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4385849c5c358e6d227a41ca2417385f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5db155f67477e1933291a27dc48b895&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44e43c7e34fa8b125c442db95b96f7bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-544f7e4425435c0cd15207e9e18a2942&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-866fa1465629067de