<node id="Luật Đất Đai">
  <data key="d0">Luật Đất Đai</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Luật Đất Đai is a comprehensive law that regulates land use, ownership, and management in Vietnam. As a legal framework, Luật Đất Đai provides the framework for the use, management, and protection of land in Vietnam, serving as the governing body responsible for managing and overseeing the utilization of land within the country. The law defines the rights and obligations of individuals and organizations in using land, including the rights and obligations of domestic organizations that are allocated or leased land. Luật Đất Đai is responsible for governing land use and allocation in Vietnam, and is the primary organization with the authority to regulate and manage land use in the country. This includes the regulation of land use rights transfer, as well as the management, use, and protection of land. Additionally, Luật Đất Đai governs the process of land retrieval and plays a vital role in shaping the country's land use policies and practices. Furthermore, Luật Đất Đai is also responsible for issuing certificates of land use rights, known as Giấy chứng nhận quyền sử dụng đất, and governing the ownership of assets attached to the land. Overall, Luật Đất Đai is a fundamental component of Vietnam's land management system, providing a clear and comprehensive framework for the management and use of land in Vietnam, and it serves as the legal basis for all activities related to land use in the country. Through its regulations and guidelines, Luật Đất Đai ultimately contributes to the overall development and growth of Vietnam. The law also covers agreements on land use rights for the implementation of socio-economic development projects, ensuring that land resources are utilized efficiently and sustainably. As the Land Law, Luật Đất Đai governs the use, allocation, and management of land in the country, making it a crucial entity in Vietnam's land management system.&lt;SEP&gt;Luật Đất Đai là bộ luật quy định về việc sử dụng đất, bao gồm các quy định về sử dụng đất kết hợp đa mục đích.&lt;SEP&gt;Luật Đất Đai is the law that governs land use and management in Vietnam.&lt;SEP&gt;Luật Đất Đai là văn bản pháp luật quy định về việc nhận quyền sử dụng đất.&lt;SEP&gt;Luật Đất Đai is the legal framework governing land use, compensation, and relocation in Việt Nam.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-959750cc315ed86f09f619c5b0719329&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a70e061012a0846dbffc0b6d3c9af4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d1525b95b179b824b107bac6bd2f0ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b956ea43d3c54759fe2af09d942807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdffa592834f59c1831a91e8118b491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-238c0daff9f5a80d35ae6e957047254b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0af8c1d084adb05c320cf722f9de8fd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6ffdf3f5c842a4183f8dfc1e3a8edaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e1f0ae97ca8c0c70bc17d356b1fd3c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a67acd907b387c57d147a645186589ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc4a4997edd2de29a91efce7db99674d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e012ca20a92b06cdb296e81a73c3ac30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d678208af9605654a8054e1ebfe2fd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86abc2f785af8819301d6dab6669b583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df9dc5b3141cd3e638d09e623ec8f4a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-441a092bb7fe3b39b917ede05c2b268f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a417aa6fdacd9dae2e9cada4adb349a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6745da57a9dcb099171a6fa7146608f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a06571049b7a52457d229c0ffd39bb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d70bb825a86d3df7a728641869f89f1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a591f57c06330b1bac4226cf3b13792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fde58cae99fc783126c061b707fb03a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b153ae4c8ce1cb77f81a9101d10988&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fd1f23cc65520c966ec1d402d52cdf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d0a130dde5b2a8f28df5fbfd9026e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6763774ff07ff17d62575eed4a3cdb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939c3d1ca63be7c24c9dbe48ca6a3c0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b987053653b257cd57b747bc876c5d7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54f539f46b71d74ed38f389f136375a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f211d7f300ff95e746e5ee68cd6adac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a67e15b0270ee52880a5e2318a0bd9e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-626a9f59751475bfa32461a0ea18621f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a50678dc89e78c25b96d5730912275a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ceb9787248c9d55f9dad634ec631e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a86f7a9b6d8d610b8e350f06cef698</data>
