<node id="Giấy Chứng Nhận Quyền Sử Dụng Đất">
  <data key="d0">Giấy Chứng Nhận Quyền Sử Dụng Đất</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Giấy Chứng Nhận Quyền Sử Dụng Đất is a legal document issued by the government to certify land use rights and ownership of attached assets in Vietnam. It serves as a certificate of land use rights, providing individuals, households, and organizations with proof of their legitimate right to utilize the land. This document not only confirms the right to use land but also verifies the ownership of assets attached to the land, which is legally recognized by the state. Giấy Chứng Nhận Quyền Sử Dụng Đất is an essential document that verifies the land use rights of a person or organization, allowing them to exercise their rights over the land. It is issued to households, individuals, and organizations that have the right to use land, including those who lease land, and is a crucial paper for confirming the ownership of land and attached assets. Additionally, Giấy Chứng Nhận Quyền Sử Dụng Đất also serves as a document that proves the land use rights of religious organizations. The certificate is typically issued to those who meet certain conditions, which may include individuals or households who have been using land without proper documentation. Overall, Giấy Chứng Nhận Quyền Sử Dụng Đất plays a vital role in confirming the legitimate use and ownership of land in Vietnam, providing necessary proof for individuals and organizations to utilize their land rights.&lt;SEP&gt;Giấy Chứng Nhận Quyền Sử Dụng Đất is a type of document that certifies land use rights.&lt;SEP&gt;Giấy Chứng Nhận Quyền Sử Dụng Đất is a type of document that certifies land use rights.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-be3a41cb0f6d889da4ace6e9d9fd4a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6ffdf3f5c842a4183f8dfc1e3a8edaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a06571049b7a52457d229c0ffd39bb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a70e061012a0846dbffc0b6d3c9af4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fde58cae99fc783126c061b707fb03a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a50678dc89e78c25b96d5730912275a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a417aa6fdacd9dae2e9cada4adb349a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a591f57c06330b1bac4226cf3b13792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab00d1578ba42cbe5a546e3b79f1ddbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ceb9787248c9d55f9dad634ec631e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d678208af9605654a8054e1ebfe2fd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86abc2f785af8819301d6dab6669b583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a86f7a9b6d8d610b8e350f06cef698&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d863e8048b2ac046f0ff270fb95a47c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b956ea43d3c54759fe2af09d942807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b153ae4c8ce1cb77f81a9101d10988&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fd1f23cc65520c966ec1d402d52cdf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54f539f46b71d74ed38f389f136375a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a67e15b0270ee52880a5e2318a0bd9e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdffa592834f59c1831a91e8118b491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0430c7cc3f6209ae0492f4d5eb6ccb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d0a130dde5b2a8f28df5fbfd9026e1d</data>
