<node id="Hộ Gia Đình, Cá Nhân">
  <data key="d0">Hộ Gia Đình, Cá Nhân</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Hộ Gia Đình, Cá Nhân refers to households and individuals in Vietnam who use land and may have various relationships with the land, including those who were allocated land without proper authority, those using land without proper documentation, and those seeking certification. They are individuals or households that utilize land and may be eligible for land allocation, with associated rights and interests related to land use. In general, Hộ Gia Đình, Cá Nhân encompasses a broad category of households and individuals who are involved in land use in Vietnam, with diverse circumstances and needs regarding land allocation, documentation, and certification.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d0a130dde5b2a8f28df5fbfd9026e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fde58cae99fc783126c061b707fb03a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b153ae4c8ce1cb77f81a9101d10988&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d1525b95b179b824b107bac6bd2f0ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a417aa6fdacd9dae2e9cada4adb349a7</data>
