<node id="Cộng Đồng Dân Cư">
  <data key="d0">Cộng Đồng Dân Cư</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Cộng Đồng Dân Cư là người sử dụng đất, chủ sở hữu tài sản gắn liền với đất.&lt;SEP&gt;Cộng Đồng Dân Cư refers to a community of Vietnamese people living in the same geographical area, such as a village, hamlet, or neighborhood. They are communities that use land and may be eligible for land allocation, and in some cases, they can receive land donations for public benefit projects. Cộng Đồng Dân Cư is also responsible for managing and preserving historical and cultural sites, and they may own and be responsible for the maintenance of community buildings and infrastructure. As a community, they are entitled to receive a certificate of land use rights and ownership of assets attached to the land. Overall, Cộng Đồng Dân Cư plays a significant role in preserving the cultural heritage and historical relics of their community, while also being involved in the management and use of land for the benefit of their members.&lt;SEP&gt;Cộng Đồng Dân Cư là đối tượng được nhận quyền sử dụng đất theo quy định của pháp luật.&lt;SEP&gt;Cộng Đồng Dân Cư refers to communities and is a type of entity involved in land disputes.&lt;SEP&gt;Cộng Đồng Dân Cư refers to communities and is a type of entity involved in land disputes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-441a092bb7fe3b39b917ede05c2b268f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a06571049b7a52457d229c0ffd39bb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fd1f23cc65520c966ec1d402d52cdf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86abc2f785af8819301d6dab6669b583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab00d1578ba42cbe5a546e3b79f1ddbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d863e8048b2ac046f0ff270fb95a47c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d45e43e8481e93a8d7815b58b2c67c3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0430c7cc3f6209ae0492f4d5eb6ccb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d0a130dde5b2a8f28df5fbfd9026e1d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1749816233</data>
</node>
<node id="Đất Nông Nghiệp">
  <data key="d0">Đất Nông Nghiệp</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Đất Nông Nghiệp is a type of land used for agricultural purposes, specifically for farming and other related activities, such as livestock production, crop cultivation, and other agricultural products. It refers to agricultural land that is utilized for the production of food, fibers, and other essential goods through agricultural activities. Đất Nông Nghiệp is a category of land that is allocated by the state to individuals for use, subject to certain limits and regulations. The primary objective of Đất Nông Nghiệp is to facilitate the production of food, fibers, and other essential goods through agricultural activities, thereby supporting the agricultural sector and contributing to the country's food security and economic development. Additionally, Đất Nông Nghiệp may also be used for other purposes, including commercial activities, services, animal husbandry, and the cultivation of medicinal plants. Overall, Đất Nông Nghiệp plays a vital role in Vietnam's agricultural landscape, and its use is governed by specific regulations regarding its allocation, transfer, and utilization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ceb9787248c9d55f9dad634ec631e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d0a130dde5b2a8f28df5fbfd9026e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc4a4997edd2de29a91efce7db99674d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b956ea43d3c54759fe2af09d942807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939c3d1ca63be7c24c9dbe48ca6a3c0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b153ae4c8ce1cb77f81a9101d10988&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d1525b95b179b824b107bac6bd2f0ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b987053653b257cd57b747bc876c5d7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e1f0ae97ca8c0c70bc17d356b1fd3c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a86f7a9b6d8d610b8e350f06cef698&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a417aa6fdacd9dae2e9cada4adb349a7</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1749780619</data>
</node>
<node id="Đất Ở">
  <data key="d0">Đất Ở</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Đất Ở is a type of land used for residential purposes, specifically for building houses and other residential purposes, such as constructing various buildings that serve daily life. In Vietnam, Đất Ở refers to residential land, which is a distinct type of land use. This type of land has specific regulations and limits on its use and allocation, indicating that there are particular rules governing how Đất Ở can be utilized. Overall, Đất Ở is dedicated to housing and other residential purposes, making it a fundamental component of urban and rural planning in the country.&lt;SEP&gt;Đất ở là loại đất được sử dụng kết hợp với mục đích nông nghiệp, thương mại, dịch vụ, công trình sự nghiệp có mục đích kinh doanh.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ceb9787248c9d55f9dad634ec631e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d0a130dde5b2a8f28df5fbfd9026e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc4a4997edd2de29a91efce7db99674d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b153ae4c8ce1cb77f81a9101d10988&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e1f0ae97ca8c0c70bc17d356b1fd3c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a86f7a9b6d8d610b8e350f06cef698&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a417aa6fdacd9dae2e9cada4adb349a7</data>
