<node id="Tài Sản Gắn Liền Với Đất">
  <data key="d0">Tài Sản Gắn Liền Với Đất</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Tài Sản Gắn Liền Với Đất refers to assets and properties that are attached to the land in Vietnam, including buildings, infrastructure, and other structures that are built or located on the land. These assets are considered properties or structures that are permanently attached to the land, and as such, are an integral part of the land itself. Tài Sản Gắn Liền Với Đất encompasses a wide range of assets, including those that are constructed on the land, such as buildings, and those that are otherwise attached to it, such as various types of infrastructure. Overall, Tài Sản Gắn Liền Với Đất is a term used to describe the assets that are attached to the land in Vietnam, and are considered an important part of the country's real estate and property landscape.&lt;SEP&gt;Tài Sản Gắn Liền Với Đất refers to assets attached to the land.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a591f57c06330b1bac4226cf3b13792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d678208af9605654a8054e1ebfe2fd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6ffdf3f5c842a4183f8dfc1e3a8edaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86abc2f785af8819301d6dab6669b583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b956ea43d3c54759fe2af09d942807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0430c7cc3f6209ae0492f4d5eb6ccb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54f539f46b71d74ed38f389f136375a0</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1749780686</data>
</node>
<node id="Nhà Ở">
  <data key="d0">Nhà Ở</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Nhà Ở refers to a house or residential building.&lt;SEP&gt;Nhà Ở refers to houses or residential buildings, which are used for living purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Nhà Ở refers to residential buildings and houses in Vietnam.&lt;SEP&gt;Nhà Ở refers to residential buildings or houses, which are structures built for human habitation.&lt;SEP&gt;Nhà ở is a type of residential building.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a591f57c06330b1bac4226cf3b13792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54f539f46b71d74ed38f389f136375a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b956ea43d3c54759fe2af09d942807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b153ae4c8ce1cb77f81a9101d10988&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a417aa6fdacd9dae2e9cada4adb349a7</data>
