<node id="Hộ Gia Đình">
  <data key="d0">Hộ Gia Đình</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Hộ Gia Đình is a household or family unit in Vietnam that has the right to use land for various purposes. The household uses land with historical and cultural relics and has collective land use rights. As a unit, Hộ Gia Đình is considered an organization that owns construction projects and is issued a Certificate of Land Use Rights and ownership of assets attached to the land. Additionally, Hộ Gia Đình is a land user that can lend land to religious organizations. Overall, Hộ Gia Đình refers to a family unit that has been granted land use certificates, allowing them to utilize the land and own assets attached to it, making them a significant entity in Vietnam's land use and management system.&lt;SEP&gt;Hộ Gia Đình refers to a household that is using land.&lt;SEP&gt;Hộ Gia Đình refers to households and is a type of entity involved in land disputes.&lt;SEP&gt;Hộ Gia Đình refers to households and is a type of entity involved in land disputes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d678208af9605654a8054e1ebfe2fd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54f539f46b71d74ed38f389f136375a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a50678dc89e78c25b96d5730912275a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a86f7a9b6d8d610b8e350f06cef698&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86abc2f785af8819301d6dab6669b583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab00d1578ba42cbe5a546e3b79f1ddbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d863e8048b2ac046f0ff270fb95a47c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ceb9787248c9d55f9dad634ec631e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0430c7cc3f6209ae0492f4d5eb6ccb39</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1749816233</data>
</node>
<node id="Thửa Đất">
  <data key="d0">Thửa Đất</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Thửa Đất is a plot of land that can belong to multiple administrative units.&lt;SEP&gt;Thửa Đất refers to a plot of land that is subject to land use regulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-86abc2f785af8819301d6dab6669b583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6ffdf3f5c842a4183f8dfc1e3a8edaf</data>
