<node id="Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Tỉnh">
  <data key="d0">Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Tỉnh</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Tỉnh is a government agency responsible for managing land use and issuing land use certificates.&lt;SEP&gt;Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Tỉnh is a government agency that plays a crucial role in various aspects of provincial administration, serving as a key organization in the provincial government. They are responsible for overseeing a wide range of activities related to land use, cultural preservation, and regional development. Specifically, Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Tỉnh is responsible for approving and implementing land use plans and projects, as well as managing and preserving historical and cultural sites, including cultural heritage sites. As a state administrative agency at the provincial level, Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Tỉnh has the authority to make decisions on investment policies and regulate land use at the local level. This includes allocating land funds and assigning land to the People's Public Security forces to ensure national security and order, particularly in high-tech zones. 

In terms of land management, Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Tỉnh is responsible for implementing land use policies and regulations, and has the authority to check the actual boundaries of land plots and decide on handling measures. They also have the power to issue certificates of land use rights and ownership of assets attached to the land to land users and owners of assets attached to the land. Furthermore, Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Tỉnh has the authority to approve agreements on receiving land use rights for the implementation of socio-economic development projects. Overall, Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Tỉnh is a local government agency that plays a vital role in implementing and enforcing laws and regulations related to land use and management, and is instrumental in promoting regional development and preserving cultural heritage.&lt;SEP&gt;Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Tỉnh is a provincial government agency responsible for resolving land disputes involving organizations, religious organizations, and foreign-invested enterprises.&lt;SEP&gt;Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Tỉnh is a provincial government agency responsible for resolving land disputes involving organizations, religious organizations, and foreign-invested enterprises.&lt;SEP&gt;Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Tỉnh is a provincial government agency responsible for resolving land disputes involving organizations, religious organizations, and foreign-invested enterprises.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-69135e33da7c09c666fadaf171536ed5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d1525b95b179b824b107bac6bd2f0ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be3a41cb0f6d889da4ace6e9d9fd4a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54f539f46b71d74ed38f389f136375a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a50678dc89e78c25b96d5730912275a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a417aa6fdacd9dae2e9cada4adb349a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a06571049b7a52457d229c0ffd39bb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6763774ff07ff17d62575eed4a3cdb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-917b6ccefd2918f28d83c9a5da27c3a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab00d1578ba42cbe5a546e3b79f1ddbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d863e8048b2ac046f0ff270fb95a47c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d45e43e8481e93a8d7815b58b2c67c3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a70e061012a0846dbffc0b6d3c9af4c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
