  <data key="d0">Quyết Định Thu Hồi Đất</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Quyết Định Thu Hồi Đất is a decision made by the authorities to requisition land, which can lead to enforcement if not complied with.&lt;SEP&gt;Quyết Định Thu Hồi Đất refers to a decision to reclaim land, which is made by the government or other authorized agencies.&lt;SEP&gt;Quyết Định Thu Hồi Đất is a decision to reclaim land, made by the government.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-50b956ea43d3c54759fe2af09d942807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84d9bf49812ff90390a147d340ed06c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-626a9f59751475bfa32461a0ea18621f</data>
