  <data key="d2">Quy Hoạch Chung is a general land use plan that guides land allocation and management at the national level.&lt;SEP&gt;Quy Hoạch Chung is a type of land use planning in Vietnam.&lt;SEP&gt;Quy hoạch chung is a type of planning that encompasses overall development.</data>
