<node id="Cá Nhân">
  <data key="d0">Cá Nhân</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Cá Nhân is an individual who plays a crucial role in the context of land use, management, and preservation of historical and cultural sites in Vietnam. As a land user, Cá Nhân has the right to use land for various purposes and can be granted land use rights, subject to certain conditions and limits. Additionally, Cá Nhân is a natural person who owns construction works and is issued a Certificate of Land Use Rights and ownership of assets attached to the land, thereby having corresponding rights and obligations related to land use. Cá Nhân is also responsible for managing and preserving historical and cultural sites, and has the ability to lend land to religious organizations. As a key entity in land use and management, Cá Nhân has various rights and responsibilities associated with these activities, including the obligation to maintain the country's cultural heritage. Overall, Cá Nhân is an individual who uses land, is a person to whom the State allocates land, leases land, and has the rights and obligations that come with being a land user and owner of assets attached to the land in Vietnam.&lt;SEP&gt;Cá Nhân là đối tượng được nhận quyền sử dụng đất theo quy định của pháp luật.&lt;SEP&gt;Cá Nhân refers to individuals and is a type of entity involved in land disputes.&lt;SEP&gt;Cá Nhân refers to individuals and is a type of entity involved in land disputes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d678208af9605654a8054e1ebfe2fd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54f539f46b71d74ed38f389f136375a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-441a092bb7fe3b39b917ede05c2b268f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a50678dc89e78c25b96d5730912275a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a06571049b7a52457d229c0ffd39bb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a86f7a9b6d8d610b8e350f06cef698&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0430c7cc3f6209ae0492f4d5eb6ccb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab00d1578ba42cbe5a546e3b79f1ddbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d863e8048b2ac046f0ff270fb95a47c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ceb9787248c9d55f9dad634ec631e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d45e43e8481e93a8d7815b58b2c67c3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d70bb825a86d3df7a728641869f89f1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b987053653b257cd57b747bc876c5d7b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1749816233</data>
</node>
