<node id="Điều 124">
  <data key="d0">Điều 124</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Điều 124 is a regulatory article that outlines the conditions for land use rights in certain cases, specifically referring to a specific article in the law related to land allocation. According to this article, Điều 124 là điều khoản trong Luật đất đai, which means it is an article in the Land Law, and it quy định về việc giao đất, meaning it regulates land allocation. Additionally, Điều 124 also deals with việc cho thuê đất, which is the leasing of land, and việc thực hiện chuyển mục đích sử dụng đất, which involves changing the purpose of land use. Overall, Điều 124 provides a comprehensive framework for various aspects of land management, including land allocation, leasing, and changes in land use purposes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ca0666d9ee9dc9838455e6bd349f7f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e95fa72656913e44897b9372de39ee00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fd9b376c1da4a3363e3db9b92809484&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8c4697d8f9c79d651403238c3f5640&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d0ee27e69be940ef4f753775a5c0e13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f52166f5e54b33b63f9f67ceb47dc6b</data>
