<node id="Tổ Chức">
  <data key="d0">Tổ Chức</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Tổ Chức is an organization that utilizes land with historical and cultural relics, and is responsible for managing and preserving these sites. As a legal entity, Tổ Chức has the rights and obligations to use land and own assets attached to it. The organization is considered a user of land and requires a land use certificate to formalize its usage. Additionally, Tổ Chức can be involved in land disputes, highlighting the complexity of its role in land management and utilization. Overall, Tổ Chức plays a significant role in the preservation and management of historical and cultural sites, while also navigating the legal and administrative aspects of land use.</data>
