<node id="Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Huyện">
  <data key="d0">Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Huyện</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Huyện is a local government agency that plays a crucial role in managing land use and resolving land-related issues at the local level. They are responsible for approving and implementing land use plans and projects, as well as issuing certificates of land use rights and ownership of assets attached to the land to individuals and organizations. Additionally, Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Huyện is tasked with implementing decisions on land requisition and organizing enforcement. One of their key functions is to resolve land disputes that arise between households, individuals, and communities, ensuring that land-related issues are addressed in a fair and timely manner. Overall, Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Huyện serves as a vital authority in overseeing land management and administration at the local level, providing essential services to the community and promoting sustainable development.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ab00d1578ba42cbe5a546e3b79f1ddbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69135e33da7c09c666fadaf171536ed5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84d9bf49812ff90390a147d340ed06c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a06571049b7a52457d229c0ffd39bb4</data>
