  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Luật Quy hoạch is a regulatory body that oversees the planning and implementation of land use plans.&lt;SEP&gt;Luật Quy hoạch is a regulatory body that provides guidelines for land use planning in Vietnam.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9e1a00a1969dce8daab43a2f32c7610e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-220a59802a0117a5cf850df3a9b1a0cf</data>
