  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Luật Nhà ở is a law governing housing, which has been amended by Luật số 43/2024/QH15.&lt;SEP&gt;Luật Nhà ở is a law related to housing and real estate in Vietnam.&lt;SEP&gt;Luật Nhà ở is a regulatory body that oversees the management and use of residential housing in Vietnam.</data>
