<node id="Đất thu hồi">
  <data key="d0">Đất thu hồi</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Đất thu hồi là loại đất bị thu hồi để thực hiện dự án hoặc kế hoạch phát triển.&lt;SEP&gt;Đất thu hồi refers to the land being requisitioned, which is a key category in the context of land use and management.&lt;SEP&gt;Đất thu hồi refers to the land acquired by the government for various purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Đất thu hồi refers to the land being acquired by the government.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d3c26e6c9ef2ffca3cc40a0524d879e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c37b91f9c12815c52aecda9f7bf35f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-001975c33df19d95e7346395a6484bb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7648a1053167bf1c59d55987c571cb6b</data>
