  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Chủ Tịch Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Huyện is the chairman of the district people's committee, responsible for making decisions on land reclamation.&lt;SEP&gt;Chủ Tịch Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Huyện is the head of the district government agency responsible for resolving land disputes.&lt;SEP&gt;Chủ Tịch Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Huyện is the head of the district people's committee, responsible for issuing decisions on enforcement and organizing the enforcement process.&lt;SEP&gt;Chủ Tịch Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Huyện is the head of the district government agency responsible for resolving land disputes.</data>
