<edge source="Việt Nam" target="Luật Đất Đai">
  <data key="d6">82.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Luật Đất Đai, which applies to Việt Nam, is a fundamental law that regulates land use and ownership within the country. It provides a framework for the management of land, governing the use and management of land in Việt Nam, and ensuring that land is utilized and managed effectively throughout the country. The law is crucial in overseeing land use and ownership, and it also includes provisions for agreements on receiving land use rights to implement socio-economic development projects. Việt Nam is the country where Luật Đất Đai is implemented, and the law plays a vital role in regulating land use and management, providing a comprehensive framework for land management and development in the country. Overall, Luật Đất Đai is essential in Việt Nam, as it governs land use and ownership, and facilitates the effective management and utilization of land resources.</data>
  <data key="d8">country,geographical scope,geography,land law,land use,law application,legal framework,legislation,legislative framework,national regulation,phạm vi áp dụng,quy định pháp luật,quốc gia,regulation,áp dụng,địa lý</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-959750cc315ed86f09f619c5b0719329&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a70e061012a0846dbffc0b6d3c9af4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b956ea43d3c54759fe2af09d942807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d0a130dde5b2a8f28df5fbfd9026e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdffa592834f59c1831a91e8118b491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939c3d1ca63be7c24c9dbe48ca6a3c0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-626a9f59751475bfa32461a0ea18621f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d678208af9605654a8054e1ebfe2fd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86abc2f785af8819301d6dab6669b583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e1f0ae97ca8c0c70bc17d356b1fd3c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a86f7a9b6d8d610b8e350f06cef698</data>
