  <data key="d6">7.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Ủy ban nhân dân cấp huyện is responsible for implementing policies and decisions regarding land use and compensation that affect Hộ gia đình, cá nhân.</data>
  <data key="d8">government-citizen interaction,land rights</data>
