<edge source="Tòa Án" target="Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Huyện">
  <data key="d6">8.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Huyện and Tòa Án are related in that they both play a role in resolving land disputes, with Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Huyện responsible for initial resolution and Tòa Án responsible for appeals and final decisions.</data>
  <data key="d8">government agencies,land dispute resolution</data>
