  <data key="d6">18.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Luật Đất đai số 45/2013/QH13 is being replaced or updated by Luật này, which has new regulations on land management and registration.&lt;SEP&gt;Luật Đất đai số 45/2013/QH13 is the previous law that regulated land use in Vietnam, while Luật này is the new law that replaces it.</data>
