  <data key="d6">8.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Quốc hội passed Nghị quyết số 132/2020/QH14, a resolution related to land use and management.</data>
  <data key="d8">lawmaking,policy</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-cad398132568f5feedf3d3e5d0967e63</data>
