  <data key="d6">8.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Ủy Ban Nhân Dân Cấp Xã and Ủy Ban Mặt Trận Tổ Quốc Việt Nam Cấp Xã collaborate to mobilize and persuade individuals to cooperate with land compensation and relocation efforts.</data>
  <data key="d8">inter-organizational cooperation,land management</data>
