<edge source="Khu Kinh Te" target="Ban Quan Ly Khu Kinh Te">
  <data key="d6">7.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Ban Quan Ly Khu Kinh Te is responsible for managing and coordinating the development of Khu Kinh Te, including land compensation and resettlement.</data>
